deterministic migrated email values, and document the cleanup.\n- Also create `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/044-043-db-migration-safety-atomic-a02-r01/hb-work/atomic/gpt-5.6-luna/oc-bench-v2-043-db-migration-safety-gpt-5.6-luna-20260831-020129-9eff7822/workspace/in/db/preflight_report.md` describing duplicate/null email issues before migration.\n- The preflight report must also mention dependent orders for dirty users `u4`, `u5`, and `u6`.\n- Also create `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/044-043-db-migration-safety-atomic-a02-r01/hb-work/atomic/gpt-5.6-luna/oc-bench-v2-043-db-migration-safety-gpt-5.6-luna-20260831-020129-9eff7822/workspace/in/db/rollback.sql` that can restore the pre-migration schema shape with id, email, name, created_at.\n- The rollback script must be executable after the migration and must restore the old schema shape.\n- Also create `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/044-043-db-migration-safety-atomic-a02-r01/hb-work/atomic/gpt-5.6-luna/oc-bench-v2-043-db-migration-safety-gpt-5.6-luna-20260831-020129-9eff7822/workspace/in/db/postcheck.sql` with verification queries that can be executed after the migration. It must check row counts, dependent order preservation, cleaned dirty-user emails, and email/status constraints.\n- Also create `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/044-043-db-migration-safety-atomic-a02-r01/hb-work/atomic/gpt-5.6-luna/oc-bench-v2-043-db-migration-safety-gpt-5.6-luna-20260831-020129-9eff7822/workspace/in/db/migration_report.md` summarizing the migration strategy, dirty-data cleanup, idempotency approach, rollback limitation/behavior, and the postcheck queries to run.\n- The migration should run inside an explicit transaction and should be idempotent: running it a second time must not corrupt or duplicate user data.\n- Use deterministic cleanup values exactly: duplicate `u4` becomes `ada+u4@example.com`; null email `u5` becomes `missing+u5@example.invalid`; blank email `u6` becomes `missing+u6@example.invalid`.\n\nThe migration must run offline in SQLite. Do not use external tools or services.\n"}],"timestamp":1788156097952},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Planning migration edits and inspection**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0b7bf0eb711d5210016a9518c4218887d28eb16ad529066595\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"<PROVIDER_ENCRYPTED_PAYLOAD_REDACTED>\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Planning migration edits and inspection**\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_hwHPsK7qOVnFw7HxuBKYMr4e|fc_0b7bf0eb711d5210016a9518cc1e5887d29b5113fdf4555030","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/044-043-db-migration-safety-atomic-a02-r01/hb-work/atomic/gpt-5.6-luna/oc-bench-v2-043-db-migration-safety-gpt-5.6-luna-20260831-020129-9eff7822/workspace/in/db/migration_policy.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_jEnNlmCWIDmzV6jroX7jb6Xb|fc_0b7bf0eb711d5210016a9518cc1e6487d2aa5b89288b79ac2e","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/044-043-db-migration-safety-atomic-a02-r01/hb-work/atomic/gpt-5.6-luna/oc-bench-v2-043-db-migration-safety-gpt-5.6-luna-20260831-020129-9eff7822/workspace/in/db/schema.sql"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_jBFH0R5d2YGxrCcQY0DYfV7V|fc_0b7bf0eb711d5210016a9518cc1e6c87d2856ed5b3c13a6754","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/044-043-db-migration-safety-atomic-a02-r01/hb-work/atomic/gpt-5.6-luna/oc-bench-v2-043-db-migration-safety-gpt-5.6-luna-20260831-020129-9eff7822/workspace/in/db/migration.sql"}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-luna","usage":{"input":1573,"output":443,"cacheRead":12800,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":67,"totalTokens":14816,"cost":{"input":0.0003146,"output":0.0005316,"cacheRead":0.000256,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0011022}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788156097960,"responseId":"resp_0b7bf0eb711d5210016a9518c3134487d29c4c0c5445630e75","rawStopReason":"completed"},{"role":"toolResul